Module resents "The Factor's chart" {
  Place quay "the quay" is room.
  Company party "You" of 1 at quay.
  // One who resents what she sees says so, and stays civil: she can still be talked to.
  Person sault "Maud Sault" at quay {
    Role "the Factor of the lightermen". Peaceable. Pronouns she.
    Resents "Maud Sault sees her own chart in your hands, and says nothing, and you will remember that she said nothing.".
  }
  Item chart "Maud Sault's chart" is map at quay owned by sault.
  Observe quay_scene at quay when true "A quay of black stone.".
  Goal false.
}
